From bf74c24cee1c64ef7b649ff27167154e2d82558c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (assist)" <munesuishemichaelmashodo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 05:37:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: make AI Content Studio work on Vercel

The Admin AI Content Studio (video scripts, captions, campaign planner)
called /api/generate-content, which only existed as an Express route in
server.ts. Vercel doesn't run that server - it's a static Vite deploy,
so every /api/* request was being caught by the SPA rewrite and served
index.html instead of JSON, causing the studio to silently fail.

- Move the Gemini generation logic into api/_lib/generateContent.ts,
  shared by both the local dev server and Vercel.
- Add api/generate-content.ts and api/health.ts as real Vercel
  serverless functions.
- Update vercel.json so the SPA fallback rewrite no longer swallows
  /api/* routes.
- server.ts now reuses the shared logic (no behavior change locally).
